---
description: NestJS API — RBAC, no business logic in controllers
globs: apps/api/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# API

- Validate every inbound DTO. Shared schemas live in `packages/validation`.
- Controllers: HTTP + guards only. Use-cases in services. Prisma stays in services/repos.
- Private routes need auth **and** authorization (role or ownership). Never `if (user.isAdmin)`.
- Order, Payment, Payout, Refund, and stock mutations must write `AuditLog`.
- Do not release seller funds on Mercado Pago `approved`; that is `HELD`.
- No stub 200s for unbuilt phases. No `any`.
